@startuml
title API Gateway - Class Diagram
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class ClientRequest {
  +method
  +path
  +headers
  +body
}

class GatewayProxyView {
  +dispatch(request)
  +resolve_service(path)
  +forward_request(request, target_url)
  +copy_response(response)
}

class ServiceRoute {
  +path_prefix
  +service_url
}

class ServiceResponse {
  +status_code
  +headers
  +body
}

GatewayProxyView "1" o-- "*" ServiceRoute
ClientRequest --> GatewayProxyView
GatewayProxyView --> ServiceResponse

note right of ServiceRoute
Configured routes:
/api/customers
/api/staff
/api/products
/api/cart
/api/orders
/api/payments
/api/shipping
/api/interactions
/api/ai
end note
@enduml

